{"ts":"2026-07-06T08:03:12.192Z","author":"maintainer-agent","op":"create","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/body","value":"GitHub: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/457\n\n## Problem (never-block violation)\n`pm health` can hang during the vectorization check with NO output until killed by an external timeout; same tracker returns immediately when vectorization is skipped. Reproduces with extensions disabled. Health is an agent-loop gating command — it must never hang silently.\n\n## Proposed fix\nHard timeout + progress/heartbeat around the vectorization probe (bounded like the lock-wait work in 010bb349); on timeout, report vectorization check as timed-out with skip hint (--skip-vectors) instead of hanging; investigate the underlying blocking call (likely embedding provider probe without socket timeout — same family as the GH-455 item).\n\n## Definition of done\npm health always returns within a bounded time with partial results on vectorization stall; timeout covered by spec with a hanging fake provider; docs note --skip-vectors."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/id","value":"pm-tu71"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/title","value":"GH-457: pm health hangs during vectorization check with no output (never-block violation)"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/description","value":"Dogfood GH-457: pm health can hang silently in the vectorization check until externally killed (reproduces with extensions disabled); gating commands must never hang. Likely same provider-probe family as GH-455 but distinct symptom (hang vs noisy failure). Duplicate check: searched health hang — no existing item."},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/type","value":"Issue"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/status","value":"open"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/priority","value":1},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/tags","value":["bug","gh-issue","health","never-block"]},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/created_at","value":"2026-07-06T08:03:12.192Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-07-06T08:03:12.192Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/author","value":"maintainer-agent"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/estimated_minutes","value":120},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/acceptance_criteria","value":"pm health always returns within a bounded time, reporting a timed-out vectorization check with --skip-vectors hint instead of hanging; spec with hanging fake provider; root blocking call identified"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/parent","value":"pm-5oj5"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/risk","value":"medium"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/confidence","value":"high"}],"before_hash":"3cc22dff72be7b14824654a7a64ea62b04799939b2fee54c1b5f52ca60bf6df0","after_hash":"3de337b818005a69da8612c13c99e5f6f629b87ebaa708421fc00f890cca096d","message":""}
